  <section class="prose" style="margin-top:75px"><p class="eyebrow">The manuscript</p><h2>What remains unresolved</h2><p class="lede">The illustrated Voynich manuscript is held at Yale’s Beinecke Library. Its writing, illustrations, and structure offer clues, but no proposed reading has become broadly accepted.</p><p>This project tests precise claims and publishes the evidence needed to inspect them. Additional computation becomes useful only after a bounded search method has earned further testing.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://beinecke.library.yale.edu/collections/highlights/voynich-manuscript">Read about the manuscript at Yale’s Beinecke Library ↗</a></section>
